  "title": "Read, write, watch, listen",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Some verbs have **o** or **e** in the stem that **rises** to **u** or **i** in certain forms (including আমি). Learn them in pairs:\n\n- শোনা 'listen': আমি **শুনি** — সে **শোনে**\n- লেখা 'write': আমি **লিখি** — সে **লেখে**\n- ওঠা 'rise': আমি **উঠি** — সে **ওঠে**\n\nNot every verb does this: **দেখা** 'see / watch' keeps its এ — আমি **দেখি**, সে **দেখে**. Learn each verb as an আমি + সে pair.\n\nObjects come **before** the verb, never after: **আমি বই পড়ি** 'I read books', **আমি গান শুনি** 'I listen to music'.\n\n**পড়া** means both 'read' and 'study'. And note **পড়ে** 'reads' vs **পরে** 'later' — same sound, different spelling.",
